Tyla, Slayyyter, Troye Sivan and more share which music videos they would want to be a part of on the VMAs 2026 red carpet.

Tetris Kelly&nbsp;

If you could go back and be in any music video, what would it be?&nbsp;

Fuerza Regida&nbsp;

&#8220;BYOB&#8221; by System of Down.&nbsp;

What? Not System of a Down, bro. Classic. Why do you want to be in that video?

JOP of Fuerza Regida&nbsp;

I don&#8217;t know. I like System of a Down.

Tyla&nbsp;

I feel like I wouldn&#8217;t be in it. I would be watching it happen. Okay. I would wanna be like watching the monitor and watching it happen in real time.

Then who you wanna watch?

Who am I gonna watch? Probably one of Michael&#8217;s.

Slayyyter&nbsp;

I would love to be one of the sweaty &#8220;Slave 4 U&#8221; sexy dancers.

Yeah.&nbsp;

They&#8217;re all like sweaty in this. What is it? Like a sauna, a pub. We don&#8217;t really know, but I love it.

Troye Sivan&nbsp;

The &#8220;Dirrty&#8221; video, Christina Aguilera. Yes. Oh my God. Some little chaps in the water. Yeah. Yeah.

Shaboozey&nbsp;

&#8220;Where the Party At?&#8221; You know, Jagged Edged and Nelly, yeah.

He went all the way back to Jagged Edge right now. That&#8217;s one of my first videos I ever saw.&nbsp;

One of my first videos when it came out the plane, when it came out the helicopter.

